This project is an UN-INSTANTIATED copy of the KWproject_template.

Start Claude Code in this folder and run:  /setup-project

The setup interview will configure the project for your specific purpose
(literature review, topic knowledge base, administrative project, curriculum
redesign, single-course redesign, or a custom blank), fill in every config
file, prune the knowledge-base folders to fit, and then DELETE this file.

Do not edit this file by hand. If you want to see what setup will do first,
read README.md (the full template explainer) — or .claude/TEMPLATE-GUIDE.md
after instantiation.
